# Generated data (tools/extract_*.py from data/raw; rebuild royalesim after regenerating)
# `data/derived/*` rather than `data/derived/`: git will not un-ignore a file inside an
# ignored DIRECTORY, so the exception below needs the contents ignored rather than the
# directory itself. Subdirectories are still covered -- they match the star as entries.
data/derived/*
# THE ONE EXCEPTION, by owner ruling 2026-09-23: the DERIVED 15.535 card table is committed.
# It is numbers -- hitpoints, timers, radii -- of the category already ruled publishable, and
# it is the file the tests actually read. Without it no clean runner can exercise the engine's
# real behaviour: 32 Rust tests failed on the first CI run because a clone builds the 2018
# table and every one of those tests is a fact about 15.535.
#
# THE RAW PACK IS STILL EXCLUDED AND THAT IS NOT THE SAME QUESTION. data/raw/cr-15.535.29/ is
# a decoded Supercell asset tree, not covered by this repository's licence (LICENSE,
# data/raw/retroroyale-2018/README.md), and pyproject keeps it out of the sdist deliberately.
# Anything that needs a RAW file rather than this derived table is a new question for the
# owner rather than something this line covers.
!data/derived/cards-15.535.json

# Ground-truth traces (large; not distributed)
data/oracle-native/

# Game-data bundles (not distributed)
data/raw/cr-*/
